      "rationale": "בעבר נהרה: 'beṛṛa n wasif' (abrar) — si tirigt n ugellid babiluni, d aḥric n utaram n Ferɛat; kra n tsuqilin qqaṛen 'utaram', wiyaḍ 'beṛṛa'."
