  ],
  "translation": "Keččin, Ɛezra, s tkerri n Eloha-nnek i deg ufus-inek tella, sbad iḥekkam d yimḥeqqen, iwakken ad ilin iḥekmen i yal aɣella n beṛṛa n wasif, i yal win issnen ccreɛ n Eloha-nnek; i win ur issin ara, melsen-as ad issin.",
